{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfPxvHfwdBbViABmAQL6C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. Here's a summary of the implementation for BE-005:\n\n## Summary of Changes\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfilment** ✅\n- Added `quantity` field to Order and Shipment (default 1, validated > 0)\n- Added `FulfilmentStatus` enum (UNALLOCATED, PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED, FULLY_ALLOCATED, DELIVERED)\n- Added `Fulfilment` data class with allocated, delivered, and status fields\n- Implemented allocation validation: shipments rejected with HTTP 409 if they would exceed order quantity\n- Added shipment transitions: `/shipments/{id}/confirm`, `/deliver`, `/cancel` with proper state validation\n- Added `PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity` endpoint to amend order quantity\n- Dynamic fulfilment calculation reflects current state of all non-cancelled shipments\n- Added `GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS` filter support\n\n### 2. **Customer Validation** ✅\n- Orders now require valid customers (HTTP 422 UnprocessableException for non-existent customers)\n- `GET /customers/{customerId}` returns HTTP 404 through error envelope (added ResourceNotFoundException)\n- Updated `OrderControllerTest` to create customers before orders\n\n### 3. **Paged Lists** ✅\n- Added `limit` (1-100, default 100) and `offset` (≥0, default 0) parameters to all list endpoints\n- Returns `X-Total-Count` header with total count before slicing\n- Validation rejects invalid limit/offset with HTTP 400 and field violations\n- On GET /orders, total reflects the fulfilment filter if provided\n\n### 4. **Error Handling** ✅\n- Added `UnprocessableException` for HTTP 422 responses\n- Added `CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND` error code\n- Consistent error envelopes across all endpoints\n\nAll existing tests pass (13/13), build succeeds, and no new dependencies were added. The Kotlin + Spring Boot architecture is preserved."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":357,"cache_read_input_tokens":70901,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":357},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7ca75136-99c1-4882-9ef3-dfd0afe64ac9","uuid":"008e998b-9292-4c06-9e55-3f6f9b9fce1e","timestamp":"2026-09-25T10:01:54.794Z","request_id":"req_011CfPxvHBRHFiCf8RFumDeu"}
